+      # B6 — BLOCKING vulnerability gate on the images this run just built.
+      #
+      # Deliberately placed AFTER the builds and BEFORE `helm upgrade`: that is
+      # the last point where refusing to ship costs nothing. A gate that ran
+      # after the rollout would only be able to tell us we had already shipped
