+      #
+      # --ignore-unfixed: only CVEs with an available fix can block, otherwise
+      # the gate is unactionable and the first instinct is to disable it.
+      # Accepted-risk CVEs live in .trivyignore with a justification and expiry.
+      - name: Vulnerability gate on built images (blocking)
